mapping "V3890.1" source="V3890" target="242116005" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V3890 = Swedish activity-subdivision of V389 (occupant of three-wheeled MV, noncollision
        transport accident, unspecified occupant injured in traffic accident) + SNOMED CT 242116005
        activity. Parent V389 crosswalk-verified to SNOMED CT 432509 (Accident to motor vehicle on road,
        not involving collision). SNOMED CT does not encode the activity dimension, so target is broader
        (source adds activity context). Moderate tier: mechanical inheritance from parent, not
        independently re-verified.
        """
}
